UsageMesh 2.2.2 accuracy and secure-session release.
- Dollar cost is API-equivalent and never multiplied by Fast/Priority quota weights.
- Standard/Fast/Priority remain explicit request metadata.
- Same-tab refresh restores a sealed browser session without storing the password or plaintext workspace key.
- Session expires after 30 minutes idle or 12 hours absolute lifetime; manual lock and tab close require the original password again.
- Device status reflects actual last-sync age and duplicate device names remain disambiguated by stable device id.
